<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP bids for nonfat dry milk.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP bids for nonfat dry milk.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday it accepted two bids from M.E. Franks Inc to sell 119 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to the Caribbean and Central and South America.</p>
<p>USDA said the bonus was $750 per tonne and the delivery period was set for Feb 7-March 31.</p>
</text>
